---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="DiskPrune - Reclaim Disk Space">
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <header class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">Reclaim Gigabytes on macOS.</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-400">Native Swift. Zero Subscriptions. Just <strong>$19</strong> for life.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center mb-20 gap-4">
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="https://github.com/saibharathsiliveri/diskprune/releases/latest/download/DiskPrune.dmg" class="bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg">
          Free Download
        </a>
        <a href="https://diskprune.lemonsqueezy.com/buy/your-variant-id?embed=1" class="lemonsqueezy-button bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg">
          Buy DiskPrune Lifetime - $19
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-lg max-w-xl text-left border border-slate-700">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-blue-400">Opening on macOS Sequoia & Sonoma</h3>
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-300">
          <li>Drag <code class="bg-slate-700 px-1 rounded">DiskPrune.app</code> to /Applications.</li>
          <li>If prompted with an untrusted developer warning, open System Settings &gt; Privacy &amp; Security.</li>
          <li>Scroll to Security and click <strong>Open Anyway</strong>.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-8 text-center">Why DiskPrune?</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-700">
              <th class="py-4 px-6">Feature</th>
              <th class="py-4 px-6 text-blue-400">DiskPrune</th>
              <th class="py-4 px-6 text-slate-500">DissectMac</th>
              <th class="py-4 px-6 text-slate-500">Disk Buddy</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-800">
              <td class="py-4 px-6">Tech Stack</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-6">Native SwiftUI</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-6">Treemap Only</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-6">Shortcuts Based</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-800">
              <td class="py-4 px-6">Pricing</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-6">$19 One-Time</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-6">Subscription</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-6">Subscription</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-800">
              <td class="py-4 px-6">APFS Snapshots</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-6">Yes</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-6">No</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-6">No</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3 class="text-2xl mb-4">Guides</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-blue-400">
        <li><a href="/blog/clear-system-data-mac" class="hover:underline">Clear System Data on Mac</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/how-to-delete-xcode-deriveddata" class="hover:underline">How to Delete Xcode DerivedData</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/shrink-docker-disk-mac" class="hover:underline">Shrink Docker Disk Mac</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/delete-purgeable-space-mac" class="hover:underline">Delete Purgeable Space Mac</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
